OL,5,G0300 1Xtra Salutes... RAYE
OL,6,     F1Xtra Salutes groundbreaking
OL,7,     Fsinger-songwriter RAYE. Sit back
OL,8,     Fand enjoy some of her best work
OL,9,     Fand collaborations including
OL,10,     FEscapism, Oscar Winning Tears and
OL,11,     FThe Weekend.
OL,12,G0400 1Xtra's R&B Slow Jamz Mix with
OL,13,G     Chuckie
OL,14,     FChuckie mixes up R&B slow jams.
OL,15,G0430 1Xtra's Throwback Thursday
OL,16,     F2007 was iconic. Soulja Boy had us
OL,17,     Fdancing, Umbrella topped the
OL,18,     Fcharts and the iPhone changed the
OL,19,     Fgame. These bangers defined an
OL,20,     Fera. Press play, turn it up and
OL,21,     Frelive it all.
